{
    "title": "Tabi Music Battle vs AGOTI",
    "description": "Boyfriend and Girlfriend incidentally get lost tonight in a strange Alley. BF encounters a former rapper - AGOTI and Tabi who keeps BF and GF captive in a rhythm game. To escape together, BF has to use his rap talent to beat AGOTI and Tabi by getting the highest score as much as possible. \r\nThere are full weeks with over 7 mods like Kaine, miku, ugh, bside, silly billy, shaggy in this game.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY?\r\n- Try your best to tap the arrow when they perfectly match.\r\n- Beat all enemies (F Alphabet, Finn, Twiddle Finger) climb to the top rank!\r\n- Feel digital rhythm! Dance with cg5! Rock the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Arrows fall follow digital melody\r\n- All mods Full enemies as you expected (Impostor V5, Indie cross)\r\n- Fantastic background with amazing sound effects\r\n- Always save your journey while you exit the game\r\n- Be updated frequently!\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFeel free to contact us via our media platforms for any issues!",
